Its probably failing to load because it depends on osf1.ko, and 
module dependancies are somewhat broken so osf1 isn't autoloaded like
it should be.

Do:

# kldload osf1
# kldload linux

Add these lines to /etc/rc.conf

osf1_enable="YES"
linux_enable="YES"


Drew


