On Thu, Jul 04, 2002 at 05:04:53PM +0200, Wilko Bulte wrote:
> You can set keyboard/language on the SRM level. Type SHOW to find it, the
> name is rather obvious (but escapes me at the moment)

There are two variables, "language" is a number and "language_name" is
a string. You have to set "language", the string is filled in by SRM.

If you don't know your language number, type something obscure and
SRM will complain and spit out the options. I did that today to find
German (32).

